Article 5 (Relationship to Other Statutes and Regulations)
(1) Where any other statute or regulation cites the former Enforcement Decree of the Korea Resources Corporation Act or any provision thereof as at the time this Decree enters into force, if this Decree contains a corresponding provision, such statute or regulation shall be deemed to cite this Decree or the corresponding provision of this Decree in lieu of the former Enforcement Decree of the Korea Resources Corporation Act or the provision thereof.

(2) Where any other statute or regulation cites a provision of the former Enforcement Decree of the Mining Damage Prevention and Restoration Act with respect to the Korea Mine Rehabilitation and Mineral Resources Corporation as at the time this Decree enters into force, if this Decree contains a corresponding provision, such statute or regulation shall be deemed to cite the corresponding provision of this Decree in lieu of the former provision.

